<title>Yemen and the Red Sea: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/yemen/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-yemen-2026-11-06T16:04:54.566Z</guid>
<pubDate>Fri, 06 Nov 2026 16:04:54 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Houthi forces continue a month-long siege of Taiz while Yemeni government troops have seized the strategic al-Jawf mountain range, intensifying front-line fighting. The coalition reports downing a Houthi ballistic missile aimed at Medina and intercepting another long-range anti-tank guided missile that struck a Saudi-backed vehicle, wounding a fighter. A market strike in southwestern Yemen killed at least 20 civilians, and a missile attack on an oil tanker in the Gulf killed a sailor. The conflict caused 918 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/nov/05/yemen-president-sacks-ministers-and-officers-houthis&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.un.org/feed/view/en/story/2026/11/1168730&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Hindu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivAFBVV95cUxQVVhxQjdGQlQ0S0NwQjVReFpaVlpSOUM3c1I4YTVMS0FhWC1zYmQ0YTEwclNHRl9uaFdseHJtenlvM2tJakhPeENNWW1hSWtfQXlBOGs5NFFQUlZHVHgzeTF2SnV2SUxUalVuT0JLRWVOeDQxdGJGTUVOTGwtc1ROcmF2VFhUaVNJUnp3TDdWU2U4bzB4M1dsR0o5VVd1OHNaOHJrYkxGLXcxV2hmeG5XOG96UGtnTlVVMDN3Wg?oc=5&quot;&gt;WSJ&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuAFBVV95cUxQcHZaVUhvY2k1UDZVODYtbHVOdzBSeGIyOFdkNVBodS1lMFg2UHppTkhJZ2VHSk1sbXlzOFV5NmVPc1QzUXdPMWRVcWJWcGVfU0hpVG4tbm1xQ3NRWjRDaE9lMW94ZXlWVEczdmp2RnpFRDdJQV92RkVwOVlRcTFPOG1rM2RVRjMydG8tVDk3NVJqNDRpUjhONTNhMGphT1JiZkZRMi0wald4SFlaZUcyZ1VzWkhRcnZB?oc=5&quot;&gt;The New Humanitarian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivgFBVV95cUxNbGJmNjdKRFVELVdXQWgyWEw1UWhmYVFwaVllRlJ5bWpDamNwRmVhcU54cnJZaWtEeHBCUDhPdFYwd3B2dTg2d2NVNjVVTTFhNXVIYi1RMDVGMThfU1pVQ29pYkNLcEgwaXI0eGczSVpndUQzQlR3SGZMdkc5STFzNHNJcWRPVFozMlRmai1xdl9xaj